## Overview

Converted the serial `test` job in `.gitea/workflows/ci.yml` into a parallel Gitea Actions matrix across the `train`, `data_quality`, and `model_contract` test suites on branch `add-test-matrix` (`http://localhost:3000/gitea-admin/fraud-detector/pulls/1`), while keeping the `lint` job intact.

- **Matrix axis (`strategy.matrix.suite`)**: `train`, `data_quality`, `model_contract`
- **Target test files**: `tests/test_train.py`, `tests/test_data_quality.py`, `tests/test_model_contract.py`
- **Verified commit**: `cca4ddd3b6294161c5fc90833195fa2b014917fd`

## Workflow Configuration (`.gitea/workflows/ci.yml`)

```yaml
name: CI

on:
  pull_request:
    branches: ["**"]
  push:
    branches: ["**"]

jobs:
  lint:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - name: Install ruff
        run: pip install --break-system-packages ruff
      - name: Run ruff
        run: ruff check src tests

  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    strategy:
      fail-fast: false
      matrix:
        suite:
          - train
          - data_quality
          - model_contract
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - name: Install pytest + runtime deps
        run: pip install --break-system-packages pytest pandas numpy scikit-learn joblib
      - name: Run ${{ matrix.suite }} test suite
        run: python3 -m pytest "tests/test_${{ matrix.suite }}.py" -v
